# Ignore everything by default, allow source/docs and their directory structure.
*
!*/
!*.py
!*.md
!LICENSE
!requirements.txt
!.gitignore
# Never include caches, local environments, data, model artifacts, or logs.
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.env*
**/.DS_Store
**/*.ipynb
**/*.pyc
/data/
/datasets/
/inputs/
/outputs/
/results/
/checkpoints/
/weights/
/logs/
